From 79b9b2db29d9b2b6c1a4a1807bc782f0d5d89f99 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LuneOS <claude.ai@herrie.org>
Date: Thu, 3 Sep 2026 18:20:49 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 100/114] build: export daemon internals to external plugins

oFono links ofonod with --export-dynamic but restricts the exported set
with --version-script=src/ofono.ver, which whitelists only ofono_* and
g_dbus_*. Symbols named __ofono_* match neither pattern and are localised.

Out-of-tree extension code that has to observe daemon state (modem and
atom watches, netreg status watches, watchlists) therefore cannot resolve
those symbols when dlopen()ed, and plugin loading fails outright with
'undefined symbol: __ofono_modemwatch_remove'.

Widen the version script so external plugins can link against the same
internals the in-tree plugins already use.

(cherry picked from commit 4deeeed4975471412e6e5462d946a104907a89b9)
Upstream-Status: Pending
---
 src/ofono.ver | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/src/ofono.ver b/src/ofono.ver
index 3dce6f3..db66b0f 100644
--- a/src/ofono.ver
+++ b/src/ofono.ver
@@ -1,6 +1,7 @@
 {
 	global:
 		ofono_*;
+		__ofono_*;
 		g_dbus_*;
 	local:
 		*;
